---
sequenceDiagram
  participant A as Agent
  participant G as Egress Proxy
  participant C as OCC
  participant R as CredentialResolver
  participant S as Secret Driver /<br/>lifecycle owner
  participant P as Provider
  A->>G: Operation with execution bearer
  G->>G: Capture immutable operation
  G->>C: Check caller, operation, route and grant online
  C-->>G: Allow, deny, or unavailable
  alt Deny or unavailable
    G-->>A: Refuse without forwarding
  else Allow
    G->>R: Resolve admitted binding for this use
    alt Static credential
      R->>S: Read or use eligible retained value
      S-->>R: Value or typed failure
      Note over R,S: Stale fallback needs eligible error and age evidence
    else Dynamic credential
      R->>S: Scoped warm token lookup only
      S-->>R: Usable token or failure
      Note over R,S: Scoped reuse, no read-triggered issuance or refresh
    end
    R-->>G: Use-bound handle or refusal
    alt Usable material
      G->>G: Finish transformations and awaited preparation
      G->>C: Fresh check: exact context and material identity/version
      C-->>G: Allow, deny, or unavailable
      G->>G: Recheck material usability and both deadlines
      alt Allow and usable within deadlines
        G->>P: Strip Agent authentication, inject, forward
        P-->>G: Response
        G-->>A: Apply response policy
      else Denied, unavailable, unusable or too late
        G-->>A: Refuse without forwarding
      end
    else Denied, missing, or unusable material
      G-->>A: Refuse without forwarding
    end
  end
  Note over A,G: Repeat for each HTTP subrequest, redirect and retry,<br/>no cached allows, including on reused connections
